      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "The approximate age of your current roof"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "The roofing material you have (shingle, metal, tile)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can help you estimate your next steps or what to look for during a professional inspection."
